0+567+360+196+90+30+4=$ **3959**\n- $[2,1^5]$: $\\sum_a F_5(30-2a)=1745+2710+3795+4840+5631+6000+5875+5280+4335+3246=$ **43457**\n- $[1^7]$: **504315**\n\n**Assembly** (composition multiplicities total 64 ✓; framework checked: unrestricted-sum version yields $10\\cdot 9^6$ ✓):\n\n| $k$ | terms | contribution |\n|---|---|---|\n| 2 | $-(2{\\cdot}2+2{\\cdot}2+2{\\cdot}2)$ | $-12$ |\n| 3 | $3{\\cdot}20+6{\\cdot}25+3{\\cdot}36+3{\\cdot}32$ | $+414$ |\n| 4 | $-(4{\\cdot}251+12{\\cdot}326+4{\\cdot}365)$ | $-6376$ |\n| 5 | $5{\\cdot}3312+10{\\cdot}3959$ | $+56150$ |\n| 6 | $-6{\\cdot}43457$ | $-260742$ |\n| 7 | $504315$ | $+504315$ |\n\nTotal: $-12+414-6376+56150-260742+504315 = 293749$.\n\nPlausibility: $293749/5314410 \\approx 0.0553$ vs unconstrained $504315/10^7 \\approx 0.0504$ — slightly more concentrated near the mean (31.5), consistent with negative adjacent-digit correlation.\n\nFINAL ANSWER: 293749", "type": "text"}], "index": 1, "model": "claude-fable-5", "role": "assistant", "type": "message"}
